{"seq":3,"slug":"distributed-time-correctness-truetime","title":"分布式系统时间正确性：漂移与因果、TrueTime/HLC、事件排序与日志时间戳","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/time-synchronization-ntp-ptp-chrony-engineering/cloud-monitoring-leap-distributed-correctness/distributed-time-correctness-truetime","wordCount":2736,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"分布式系统时间正确性-漂移与因果-truetime-hlc-事件排序与日志时间戳\">分布式系统时间正确性：漂移与因果、TrueTime/HLC、事件排序与日志时间戳</h1><p>一台机器的钟再准，也只保证「它自己的读数接近真值」。一旦跨机器，问题就从「准不准」变成「谁先谁后」——这两件事在分布式系统里根本不是同一种保证。一个 NTP 客户端可以在 10 ms 内跟随 UTC，却在两次交易之间给出与另一台机器相反的顺序。本文拆开这层混淆：漂移如何变成因果排序错误，TrueTime 与 HLC 各用什么代价换取顺序，以及日志时间戳为什么总在骗你。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-漂移与因果-为什么-同步-不等于-顺序\">核心概念：漂移与因果——为什么「同步」不等于「顺序」</h2><p>物理时钟的两个误差量必须分开记。<strong>偏斜 offset</strong> 是两钟当前读数之差；<strong>漂移 skew</strong> 是它们<strong>走时速率的差</strong>。偏斜可靠一次校正抹掉，漂移不能——只要两机振荡器的归一化频率偏差不同，偏差就以此差值持续累积：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>offset</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≈</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>offset</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_{\\text{offset}}(t) \\approx \\Delta_{\\text{offset}}(0) + \\int_0^t \\left[ y_A(\\tau) - y_B(\\tau) \\right] d\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">offset</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">offset</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4554em;vertical-align:-0.9119em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"margin-right:0.4445em;position:relative;top:-0.0011em;\">∫</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5435em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.7881em;margin-left:-0.4445em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8129em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9119em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">]</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>若两机各带 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\times10^{-8}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">8</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（10 ppb）量级的频率偏差，一天累积约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>86400</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.86</mn><mtext> ms</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">86400 \\times 10^{-8} \\approx 0.86\\ \\text{ms}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">86400</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">8</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.86</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ms</span></span></span></span></span></span> 的单向漂移；OCXO 之间的残余漂移低几个数量级，但<strong>永不为零</strong>。这是「同步」只能表现为<strong>有界误差</strong>而非「相等」的根本原因，也是 <a href=\"../clock-hardware-timescale-foundations/clock-oscillator-allan-variance\">时钟源与振荡器：Allan 方差</a> 中 ADEV 决定「两次同步之间能撑多久」的原因。</p>\n<p>真正致命的不是误差大小，而是<strong>误差让你无法确定事件顺序</strong>。A 写 <code>x=1</code>，B 读到 1 后写 <code>y=1</code>，C 读到 <code>y=0</code>；用各机本地时间戳排序，只要钟差超过 A→B 的真实间隔，排序就可能变成「C 早于 B」，推出物理上不可能的执行历史。分布式正确性依赖<strong>因果关系</strong>（happens-before，Lamport 1978），而非墙上时间；物理时钟只是它的<strong>近似代理</strong>——不提供误差上界的同步在定序语义里不构成保证。</p>\n<h2 id=\"truetime-用不确定区间把-可能顺序-变成-确定顺序\">TrueTime：用不确定区间把「可能顺序」变成「确定顺序」</h2><p>Google Spanner 的核心观察是：与其假装时钟准确，不如<strong>显式携带不确定性</strong>。TrueTime 返回的不是一个时刻，而是一个区间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>earliest</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>latest</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[t_{\\text{earliest}},\\ t_{\\text{latest}}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">earliest</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">latest</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>TT.now()</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{TT.now()} = t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">TT.now()</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 时保证真实时间落在此区间内，即 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>earliest</mtext></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>abs</mtext></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>latest</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{earliest}} \\le t_{\\text{abs}} \\le t_{\\text{latest}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.786em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">earliest</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.786em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">abs</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">latest</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，半宽记为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span>。两条规则把区间转化为全局序：<strong>起点规则</strong>取提交时间戳 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>TT.now().latest</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s = \\text{TT.now().latest}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">TT.now().latest</span></span></span></span></span></span>；**提交等待（commit-wait）**要求事务在对外可用前等到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>TT.now().earliest</mtext><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{TT.now().earliest} &gt; s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">TT.now().earliest</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span>，即「所有机器的当前时间都已越过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span>」。</p>\n<p>两者合起来给出<strong>外部一致性</strong>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 开始前提交完成，则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>timestamp</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mtext>timestamp</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{timestamp}(T_1) &lt; \\text{timestamp}(T_2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">timestamp</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">timestamp</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。代价是每次提交等待约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span>（Google 公布的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span> 在多数数据中心为个位数毫秒）——用<strong>延迟</strong>换<strong>顺序</strong>，把时钟不确定性的成本显性化到每次提交。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    START[&quot;事务准备提交&quot;] --&gt; NOW[读 TrueTime 区间&lt;br/&gt;[earliest, latest]&quot;]&#10;    NOW --&gt; PICK[&quot;提交时间戳 s = latest&quot;]&#10;    PICK --&gt; WAIT{&quot;TT.now().earliest &gt; s ?&quot;}&#10;    WAIT --&gt;|&quot;否:仍在不确定窗口内&quot;| WAIT&#10;    WAIT --&gt;|&quot;是:区间已越过 s&quot;| COMMIT[&quot;赋值 s 并对外可见&lt;br/&gt;外部一致性成立&quot;]\">graph TD\n    START[\"事务准备提交\"] --&gt; NOW[读 TrueTime 区间&lt;br/&gt;[earliest, latest]\"]\n    NOW --&gt; PICK[\"提交时间戳 s = latest\"]\n    PICK --&gt; WAIT{\"TT.now().earliest &gt; s ?\"}\n    WAIT --&gt;|\"否:仍在不确定窗口内\"| WAIT\n    WAIT --&gt;|\"是:区间已越过 s\"| COMMIT[\"赋值 s 并对外可见&lt;br/&gt;外部一致性成立\"]</pre><p>TrueTime 的亚结构由<strong>多源冗余</strong>支撑：每个数据中心部署若干 GPS 接收器与原子钟，GPS 提供长期准确度，原子钟（铷钟）在 GPS 失锁或受欺骗时提供保持（holdover）——这也是 <a href=\"../ptp-ieee1588-high-precision/ptp-hardware-timestamping-transparent-clock\">PTP 硬件时间戳与透明时钟</a> 讨论的同一类保持思想，只是 TrueTime 把冗余做成了服务（见 <a href=\"https://docs.cloud.google.com/spanner/docs/true-time-external-consistency\">Google Spanner TrueTime 文档</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"hlc-不需要专用硬件也能给出单调时间戳\">HLC：不需要专用硬件也能给出单调时间戳</h2><p>TrueTime 的代价是 GPS + 原子钟 + 专用基础设施。CockroachDB 走另一条路：<strong>混合逻辑时钟（HLC）</strong>。每个节点的 HLC 时间戳由物理分量（本地墙上时钟）与逻辑分量（同一物理时刻内的计数器）组成，核心不变式是 <strong>HLC 时间戳始终 ≥ 本地墙上时间</strong>。发送消息时带上本地 HLC，接收方推进自己的 HLC；同一物理毫秒内的多个事件靠逻辑分量区分，因此<strong>时间戳严格单调且不回退</strong>——即使本地时钟向后跳。</p>\n<p>HLC 的取舍是：保证<strong>带因果的单调性</strong>，但<strong>不保证与真实时间的偏差有界</strong>。CockroachDB 因此要求配置<strong>最大时钟偏移（max offset，默认 500 ms）</strong>；节点若发现自己的时钟与集群中至少一半节点相差达<strong>配置最大偏移的 80%</strong>，会立即崩溃——把「钟坏掉」变成「节点主动退出」的<strong>故障显性化</strong>：宁可拒绝服务，也不产出违反线性一致性的顺序（见 <a href=\"https://docs.cockroachlabs.com/docs/stable/architecture/transaction-layer\">CockroachDB 事务层文档</a>）。</p>\n<p>HLC 还有一个特有机制：<strong>不确定区间错误</strong>。读操作遇到时间戳落在「可能是过去、也可能是未来」区间内的值时抛出 <code>ReadWithinUncertaintyIntervalError</code>，DB 的处理是<strong>读刷新（read refresh）</strong>——把事务时间戳推到该值之后并重新验证此前读过的数据未变；刷新失败则事务在 <code>SERIALIZABLE</code> 下重试。<code>READ COMMITTED</code> 不做提交时读刷新，用语句级重试解决大部分冲突。<strong>对工程的含义</strong>：HLC 把时钟偏移的成本转化成<strong>应用可见的重试</strong>，而非静默的顺序错误。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>顺序保证</th>\n<th>时间偏差有界？</th>\n<th>主要代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>TrueTime + commit-wait</td>\n<td>外部一致性（线性一致）</td>\n<td>是，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>ϵ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>ϵ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[t-\\epsilon,\\ t+\\epsilon]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8095em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>提交延迟 ≈ 2ε，依赖 GPS + 原子钟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HLC（CockroachDB）</td>\n<td>因果单调、可串行化</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>不确定区间重试，需配最大偏移</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>纯本地墙上时钟</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>顺序可能物理不可能</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Lamport 逻辑时钟</td>\n<td>因果序（偏序）</td>\n<td>不适用</td>\n<td>不能比较并发事件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"日志时间戳-为什么事故复盘里的顺序经常是假的\">日志时间戳：为什么事故复盘里的顺序经常是假的</h2><p>生产环境里最常被误用为「真相」的是日志时间戳，而它是<strong>最弱的一种时间证据</strong>。它来自各自主机的墙上时钟，写日志的进程可能被调度延迟、缓冲后批量落盘、经代理转发时被重新盖戳、或在容器里共享一个未同步的宿主时钟——任何一条都会让「时间 A &lt; 时间 B」不等于「事件 A 先于 B」。三条规则：</p>\n<p><strong>第一，日志必须携带时钟误差元数据。</strong> 只写 <code>2026-10-05T12:00:00.123Z</code> 无法判断这条记录的可信半径；同时写出该主机的同步状态（如 chrony <code>tracking</code> 的 offset、stratum、leap status）才能界定误差。这与 <a href=\"../ntp-protocol-chrony-operations/ntp-security-nts-monitoring\">NTP 安全、NTS 与监控</a> 的同步健康观测是同一套数据。</p>\n<p><strong>第二，跨服务追踪不要用墙上时间做跨度计算。</strong> 用单调时钟（<code>CLOCK_MONOTONIC</code>）测持续时间，墙上时间只做展示。单调时钟不因校正或闰秒而回退——这正是 <a href=\"../clock-hardware-timescale-foundations/timescale-utc-tai-gps-monotonic\">UTC、TAI、GPS 与单调时钟</a> 区分两者的理由。</p>\n<p><strong>第三，用因果标记补足时间戳。</strong> 在 trace 中传播逻辑序号（或直接用 HLC 时间戳），让重放工具恢复正确的偏序。对结算类业务，落库时间戳应使用数据库分配的提交时间戳，而非应用进程的本地时间。</p>\n<h2 id=\"闰秒-唯一能让-时间前进-变成-时间倒退-的输入\">闰秒：唯一能让「时间前进」变成「时间倒退」的输入</h2><p>分布式正确性还有一个来自<strong>时标定义本身</strong>的风险：闰秒。UTC 插入闰秒时会出现 <code>23:59:60</code>，天真的时间处理（<code>tm_sec + 1</code> 后归一化）会把它折回 <code>23:59:59</code> 或跳成 <code>00:00:00</code>——前者让时间倒退，后者让某些 Unix 时间值重复，任何以「时间戳单调」为前提的排序逻辑都会在此刻失效。三种处理策略：<strong>跳变（step）<strong>直接改时钟，最简单但会把「时间倒退」引入系统；<strong>缓慢调整（slew）<strong>让 <code>adjtime</code>/<code>chrony</code> 在较长时间内摊销，保持平滑、避免回退；<strong>涂抹（smear）<strong>把这一秒摊平到一段窗口内——Google 的标准是</strong>从闰秒前后各 12 小时做 24 小时线性涂抹</strong>，期间时钟走速变化约 <strong>11.6 ppm</strong>，与 UTC 的最大差异</strong>略小于 0.5 秒</strong>，窗口覆盖 <strong>86,401 个 SI 秒</strong>却只指示 <strong>86,400 秒</strong>（见 <a href=\"https://developers.google.com/time/smear\">Google leap smear</a>）。AWS 也采用涂抹。<strong>涂抹最危险处在于它创造两种「UTC」</strong>：涂抹与不涂抹的机器在同一时刻读数不同，差异持续整个窗口——跨云混用时必须</strong>统一策略</strong>，或先转换回未涂抹时间再比较（Google 提供 <code>unsmear</code> 库）。</p>\n<p>监管层面正在收口这一风险：CGPM 第 27 届会议（2022）<strong>第 4 号决议</strong>决定「将 UT1−UTC 的最大允许值在 2035 年或之前提高」，目标是在至少一个世纪内不再插入常规闰秒，并要求 CIPM 与 ITU 协商制定新限值、实施计划与审议周期，提交 <strong>2026 年第 28 届 CGPM</strong> 批准（见 <a href=\"https://www.bipm.org/en/committees/cg/cgpm/27-2022/resolution-4\">BIPM CGPM 2022 Resolution 4</a>）。<strong>但闰秒的终结尚未生效</strong>——此前仍可能出现最后一次插入，掩码与阈值必须显式配置。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    T[&quot;UTC 进入闰秒窗口&quot;] --&gt; Q{&quot;系统策略?&quot;}&#10;    Q --&gt;|&quot;step 跳变&quot;| S1[&quot;时间可能倒退&lt;br/&gt;破坏单调假设&quot;]&#10;    Q --&gt;|&quot;slew 平滑&quot;| S2[&quot;chrony 摊销&lt;br/&gt;不回退但速率偏移&quot;]&#10;    Q --&gt;|&quot;smear 涂抹&quot;| S3[&quot;24h 线性&lt;br/&gt;±0.5s 内, 11.6 ppm&quot;]&#10;    S3 --&gt; MIX{&quot;跨系统比较?&quot;}&#10;    MIX --&gt;|&quot;混用涂抹&quot;| BAD[&quot;两种 UTC 冲突&lt;br/&gt;需 unsmear 转换&quot;]&#10;    MIX --&gt;|&quot;策略统一&quot;| OK[&quot;顺序保持一致&quot;]\">graph TD\n    T[\"UTC 进入闰秒窗口\"] --&gt; Q{\"系统策略?\"}\n    Q --&gt;|\"step 跳变\"| S1[\"时间可能倒退&lt;br/&gt;破坏单调假设\"]\n    Q --&gt;|\"slew 平滑\"| S2[\"chrony 摊销&lt;br/&gt;不回退但速率偏移\"]\n    Q --&gt;|\"smear 涂抹\"| S3[\"24h 线性&lt;br/&gt;±0.5s 内, 11.6 ppm\"]\n    S3 --&gt; MIX{\"跨系统比较?\"}\n    MIX --&gt;|\"混用涂抹\"| BAD[\"两种 UTC 冲突&lt;br/&gt;需 unsmear 转换\"]\n    MIX --&gt;|\"策略统一\"| OK[\"顺序保持一致\"]</pre><h2 id=\"把正确性做进设计-三条可执行准则\">把正确性做进设计：三条可执行准则</h2><p><strong>准则一：先问「需要什么级别的顺序」，再选时钟方案。</strong> 单机内部事件用单调时钟；跨机强一致事务需要 TrueTime 式有界误差或 HLC 式重试；跨机弱一致分析用逻辑时钟与因果标记即可。<strong>不要为只需要偏序的问题付出外部一致性的延迟，也不要为需要线性一致性的问题只配「大致同步」的 NTP</strong>——后者会以极低概率产生灾难性错误，极难复现。判断是否够用：把实测 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>offset</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_{\\text{offset}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">offset</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与业务允许的最大事件间隔比较，误差上界不显著小于该间隔就不可靠。</p>\n<p><strong>准则二：让时钟故障可见、可阻断。</strong> CockroachDB 用「80% 最大偏移即崩溃」把时钟问题变成可观测的节点退出，远好于静默给出错误顺序。生产系统应设置偏移阈值告警、同步失效时的降级策略（拒绝写入 vs 继续服务并标记不确定性）、并把同步状态写入关键日志，使事故复盘能界定时间戳的可信半径。</p>\n<p><strong>准则三：时间戳的来源与用途必须显式分层。</strong> 四类时钟不可混用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>墙上时间</strong>——给人与合规看的时刻，不承担定序职责；</li>\n<li><strong>单调时钟</strong>——测量持续时长与超时，绝不回退；</li>\n<li><strong>逻辑/HLC 时间戳</strong>——承载跨服务排序与因果传播；</li>\n<li><strong>数据库提交时间戳</strong>——代表事务的权威顺序与一致性边界。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>把这四类混为一谈，是分布式时间 bug 最常见的来源。设计阶段的每项决定都应像 <a href=\"../clock-hardware-timescale-foundations/clock-offset-skew-error-budget\">时钟偏斜、频率偏差与误差预算</a> 那样给出<strong>显式误差预算</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>时间正确性最终是一个<strong>契约问题</strong>：每一层必须向下层声明「我需要什么级别的顺序保证」，向上层声明「我能提供的误差上界」。TrueTime 与 HLC 之所以值得学，不在于技术细节，而在于它们把这层契约<strong>写进了接口</strong>——一个返回区间，一个允许重试，都不假装时钟是完美的。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"分布式系统时间正确性：漂移与因果、TrueTime/HLC、事件排序与日志时间戳","id":"分布式系统时间正确性-漂移与因果-truetime-hlc-事件排序与日志时间戳"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：漂移与因果——为什么「同步」不等于「顺序」","id":"核心概念-漂移与因果-为什么-同步-不等于-顺序"},{"level":2,"text":"TrueTime：用不确定区间把「可能顺序」变成「确定顺序」","id":"truetime-用不确定区间把-可能顺序-变成-确定顺序"},{"level":2,"text":"HLC：不需要专用硬件也能给出单调时间戳","id":"hlc-不需要专用硬件也能给出单调时间戳"},{"level":2,"text":"日志时间戳：为什么事故复盘里的顺序经常是假的","id":"日志时间戳-为什么事故复盘里的顺序经常是假的"},{"level":2,"text":"闰秒：唯一能让「时间前进」变成「时间倒退」的输入","id":"闰秒-唯一能让-时间前进-变成-时间倒退-的输入"},{"level":2,"text":"把正确性做进设计：三条可执行准则","id":"把正确性做进设计-三条可执行准则"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"时间可观测性：chrony/PTP 指标、时钟偏差告警、SLO 与混沌测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/time-synchronization-ntp-ptp-chrony-engineering/cloud-monitoring-leap-distributed-correctness/time-observability-monitoring-slo"},"next":null}